sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Creator
    participant P as YouTube Player
    participant S as State (in-memory)
    participant LS as localStorage
    participant E as Encoder

    U->>P: Paste YouTube URL
    P->>P: Load video via IFrame API
    loop Watch and comment
        U->>P: Click "Pop!" button
        P->>P: Auto-pause
        P->>S: getCurrentTime() → timestamp
        U->>S: Type comment text
        S->>LS: Auto-save draft
    end
    U->>E: Click "Generate Link"
    E->>E: JSON → LZ-String compress → base64
    E->>U: Copy URL to clipboard

    participant V as Viewer
    participant D as Decoder
    participant B as Bubble Engine

    V->>D: Open shared URL
    D->>D: Read hash → decompress → parse JSON
    D->>P: Load video
    loop Playback
        B->>P: Poll getCurrentTime() every 250ms
        B->>V: Show bubble when timestamp reached
        B->>B: Auto-dismiss after delay
    end
